OL,3,GNEWSA'We put Middlesbrough on the map
OL,4,Afor dance music'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"At the time, I took a big chance with
OL,7,Fthat place," Faulkner Sr said of taking
OL,8,Fthe former bingo hall and turning it
OL,9,Finto a club, adding: "I think it
OL,10,Fcleared me out of money when I first
OL,11,Fgot it."
